  "notes": "{値引|ねび}き means a reduction in price. Formed from {値|ね} (price) + {引|ひ}く (to pull/reduce).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {値引|ねび}きする: to discount\n- {値引|ねび}きしてもらう: to get a discount\n- {値引|ねび}き{交渉|こうしょう}: price negotiation\n- {大幅|おおはば}{値引|ねび}き: significant discount\n- {値引|ねび}き{価格|かかく}: discounted price\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {割引|わりびき}: discount (often percentage-based; 10%{割引|わりびき})\n- セール: sale (general retail event)\n- {特価|とっか}: special price\n- {安売|やすう}り: bargain sale\n\nNOTE:\n{値引|ねび}き usually implies negotiating a lower price, while {割引|わりびき} is a pre-set reduction (coupon, membership, etc.).",
